              "text": "il testamento — \"the will, the testament\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Il nonno ha lasciato un testamento. Grandfather left a will."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Fare testamento — to make a will."
